[
  {
    "title": "Boolean Logic",
    "tag": "LESSON 10",
    "time": "0–2 min",
    "code": "Chapter 3 · Algorithms & Programming",
    "html": "<p class=\"lead\">AP Computer Science Principles</p><h1>Boolean<br>Logic</h1><p class=\"zh\">布尔值 · 关系运算 · 逻辑运算</p><p class=\"small\">Build and test a Workshop Rule Checker · 90 minutes</p>",
    "note": "本课把表达式从数字与字符串扩展为true/false。先让学生写出并测试条件值，不使用还未学习的IF分支。课堂作品只根据假想规则报告Boolean结果，不是实际门禁系统。",
    "kind": "dark"
  },
  {
    "title": "Retrieve three foundation ideas",
    "tag": "RETRIEVAL",
    "time": "2–6 min",
    "code": "AAP-1.A/B · AAP-2.C",
    "html": "<ol><li>Evaluate 13 / 4 and 13 MOD 4.</li><li>Is \"12\" a numeric literal or a string literal?</li><li>After a ← 4; b ← a; a ← 9, what is b?</li></ol><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\"><strong>3.25 and 1; string; 4.</strong> Distinguish type, operation and stored value.</div></details>",
    "note": "前两题从L09提取，第三题再次检查复制赋值。让学生说明理由，避免Boolean课开始后仍把字符串\"true\"和Boolean true混淆。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Build conditions you can explain",
    "tag": "LEARNING GOALS",
    "time": "6–8 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.E/F",
    "html": "<ol><li>Write comparisons that produce true or false.</li><li>Combine them with AND, OR and NOT.</li><li>Check boundaries and logical equivalence.</li><li>Build and test a rule checker.</li></ol><p class=\"callout\">Today we compute a condition. Later, IF will use it.</p>",
    "note": "把求条件值和按条件执行动作分开。完成Boolean表达式已经是程序的一部分，不需要提前用分支。学生最后必须能解释一个边界测试与一次修订。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Comparisons return Boolean values",
    "tag": "RELATIONAL OPERATORS",
    "time": "8–12 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.E.1–2",
    "html": "<p class=\"lead\">Compare compatible values to get true or false.</p><figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Six relational operators: equal, not equal, greater or less, and inclusive boundaries.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 160\" style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"15.0\" y=\"12\" width=\"356.6666666666667\" height=\"126\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"193.33333333333334\" y=\"48\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" font-weight=\"700\">Equality</text><text x=\"193.33333333333334\" y=\"103\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"30\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">=   ≠</text><rect x=\"421.6666666666667\" y=\"12\" width=\"356.6666666666667\" height=\"126\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"48\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" font-weight=\"700\">Strict comparison</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"103\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"30\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">&gt;   &lt;</text><rect x=\"828.3333333333334\" y=\"12\" width=\"356.6666666666667\" height=\"126\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1006.6666666666667\" y=\"48\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" font-weight=\"700\">Include equality</text><text x=\"1006.6666666666667\" y=\"103\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"30\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">≥   ≤</text></svg></figure><p>Evaluate 8 ≤ 8 and 8 ≠ 8.</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\"><strong>true; false.</strong> The equality part of ≤ includes the boundary.</div></details>",
    "note": "六种符号都要会读，重点区分严格与包含边界。使用数值比较与相容类型，不讨论字符串排序或类型强制转换。关系运算产出Boolean，不更改比较对象。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Assignment stores a Boolean too",
    "tag": "VALUES & ASSIGNMENT",
    "time": "12–16 min",
    "code": "AAP-1.A/B · AAP-2.E",
    "html": "<pre class=\"code\" style=\"font-size:26px;line-height:1.3\">minutes ← 30\ngoalMet ← (minutes ≥ 30)</pre><figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A number is compared to a threshold and the Boolean result is stored in goalMet.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 160\" style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"15.0\" y=\"12\" width=\"356.6666666666667\" height=\"121\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"193.33333333333334\" y=\"48\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" font-weight=\"700\">Read a number</text><text x=\"193.33333333333334\" y=\"103\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"30\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">minutes: 30</text><path d=\"M380.6666666666667 72.5H401.6666666666667\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M399.6666666666667 65.5L413.6666666666667 72.5L399.6666666666667 79.5Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"421.6666666666667\" y=\"12\" width=\"356.6666666666667\" height=\"121\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"48\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" font-weight=\"700\">Compare</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"103\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"30\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">minutes ≥ 30</text><path d=\"M787.3333333333334 72.5H808.3333333333334\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M806.3333333333334 65.5L820.3333333333334 72.5L806.3333333333334 79.5Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"828.3333333333334\" y=\"12\" width=\"356.6666666666667\" height=\"121\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1006.6666666666667\" y=\"48\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" font-weight=\"700\">Store Boolean</text><text x=\"1006.6666666666667\" y=\"103\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"30\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">goalMet ← result</text></svg></figure><p>What value is stored in goalMet?</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\"><strong>true.</strong> ← assigns a value; = compares equality.</div></details><p class=\"small\">true is a Boolean; \"true\" is a string.</p>",
    "note": "变量能够存储Boolean表达式求得的结果。区分←赋值与=相等比较，不把数学等式的直觉变成程序更新规则。JSON输入中true不加引号；\"true\"是另一类型。"
  },
  {
    "title": "AND requires both conditions",
    "tag": "LOGICAL AND",
    "time": "16–20 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.F.1/3/5",
    "html": "<p class=\"lead\">A AND B is true only when both A and B are true.</p><figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Two Boolean conditions feed an AND operation; both are required for a true result.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 185\" style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"20\" y=\"18\" width=\"340\" height=\"60\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"190\" y=\"57\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"400\">A: has a ticket</text><rect x=\"20\" y=\"107\" width=\"340\" height=\"60\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"190\" y=\"146\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"400\">B: door is open</text><path d=\"M360 48H460V92H520M360 137H460V92\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><rect x=\"520\" y=\"51\" width=\"200\" height=\"80\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"620\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"34\" fill=\"#28766f\" font-weight=\"700\">AND</text><path d=\"M720 92H808\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M806 85L820 92L806 99Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"825\" y=\"51\" width=\"350\" height=\"80\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1000\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"400\">Both must be true</text></svg></figure><p>What if A is true and B is false?</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\"><strong>false.</strong> One satisfied requirement is not enough.</div></details>",
    "note": "图中的票与门仅用于解释两个同时必要条件，不能拿自然语言顺序当执行顺序。可让同桌各持一张true/false卡，只有两人都true才举起AND卡。"
  },
  {
    "title": "OR includes the case where both are true",
    "tag": "LOGICAL OR",
    "time": "20–24 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.F.4–5",
    "html": "<p class=\"lead\">A OR B is true when at least one operand is true.</p><figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Two alternative Boolean conditions feed OR; one or both being true is sufficient.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 185\" style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"20\" y=\"18\" width=\"340\" height=\"60\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"190\" y=\"57\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"400\">A: has a ticket</text><rect x=\"20\" y=\"107\" width=\"340\" height=\"60\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"190\" y=\"146\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"400\">B: has a pass</text><path d=\"M360 48H460V92H520M360 137H460V92\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><rect x=\"520\" y=\"51\" width=\"200\" height=\"80\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"620\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"34\" fill=\"#28766f\" font-weight=\"700\">OR</text><path d=\"M720 92H808\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M806 85L820 92L806 99Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"825\" y=\"51\" width=\"350\" height=\"80\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1000\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"400\">One or both true</text></svg></figure><p>What if the person has both a ticket and a pass?</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\"><strong>true.</strong> AP OR is inclusive: both true is allowed.</div></details>",
    "note": "明确inclusive OR包含双方都true，不能用生活中“选饮料A或B且只能一种”的互斥语境替代。这里不引入XOR语法，只解释官方OR的四种组合。"
  },
  {
    "title": "A truth table covers every two-input case",
    "tag": "TRUTH TABLE",
    "time": "24–28 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.F.3–4",
    "html": "<p class=\"small\">Complete the two result columns in this row order.</p><figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Four combinations of A and B with blank AND and OR results for students to complete.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 220\" style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><text x=\"150\" y=\"31\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" fill=\"#225a83\" font-weight=\"700\">A</text><text x=\"450\" y=\"31\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" fill=\"#225a83\" font-weight=\"700\">B</text><text x=\"750\" y=\"31\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" fill=\"#225a83\" font-weight=\"700\">A AND B</text><text x=\"1050\" y=\"31\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" fill=\"#225a83\" font-weight=\"700\">A OR B</text><rect x=\"15\" y=\"53\" width=\"1170\" height=\"37\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#eef3f6\"/><text x=\"150\" y=\"81\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"400\">true</text><text x=\"450\" y=\"81\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"400\">true</text><text x=\"750\" y=\"81\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"400\">?</text><text x=\"1050\" y=\"81\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"400\">?</text><rect x=\"15\" y=\"93\" width=\"1170\" height=\"37\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\"/><text x=\"150\" y=\"121\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"400\">true</text><text x=\"450\" y=\"121\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"400\">false</text><text x=\"750\" y=\"121\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"400\">?</text><text x=\"1050\" y=\"121\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"400\">?</text><rect x=\"15\" y=\"133\" width=\"1170\" height=\"37\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#eef3f6\"/><text x=\"150\" y=\"161\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"400\">false</text><text x=\"450\" y=\"161\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"400\">true</text><text x=\"750\" y=\"161\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"400\">?</text><text x=\"1050\" y=\"161\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"400\">?</text><rect x=\"15\" y=\"173\" width=\"1170\" height=\"37\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\"/><text x=\"150\" y=\"201\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"400\">false</text><text x=\"450\" y=\"201\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"400\">false</text><text x=\"750\" y=\"201\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"400\">?</text><text x=\"1050\" y=\"201\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"400\">?</text></svg></figure><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">Rows (AND, OR): <strong>(true, true); (false, true); (false, true); (false, false).</strong></div></details>",
    "note": "四行完整列出两Boolean输入的全部组合，结果列保留问号供学生作答。先分别依据定义填列，再比较AND仅一行true、OR仅一行false；不是背字母排列。"
  },
  {
    "title": "NOT reverses one Boolean result",
    "tag": "LOGICAL NOT",
    "time": "28–32 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.F.2",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"NOT maps true to false and maps false to true.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 160\" style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"15.0\" y=\"12\" width=\"560.0\" height=\"126\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"295.0\" y=\"48\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" font-weight=\"700\">Input true</text><text x=\"295.0\" y=\"103\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"30\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">NOT true = false</text><rect x=\"625.0\" y=\"12\" width=\"560.0\" height=\"126\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"905.0\" y=\"48\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" font-weight=\"700\">Input false</text><text x=\"905.0\" y=\"103\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"30\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">NOT false = true</text></svg></figure><p class=\"lead\">Evaluate NOT (7 &gt; 10).</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\"><strong>true.</strong> First 7 &gt; 10 is false; then NOT reverses it.</div></details><p class=\"small\">Parentheses show exactly which expression is negated.</p>",
    "note": "NOT不是简单把符号方向随意改动。先求括号内的Boolean再翻转。对于否定大于，包含等于的部分也要保留，因此NOT(x>10)对应x≤10。"
  },
  {
    "title": "A closed range needs two comparisons",
    "tag": "INCLUSIVE RANGE",
    "time": "32–36 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.E/F",
    "html": "<p class=\"lead\">A workshop accepts ages 12 through 17, inclusive.</p><figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"The interval from12 to17 is highlighted, with filled endpoints showing inclusion.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 155\" style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><path d=\"M80 85H1120\" stroke=\"#193148\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M340 85H860\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"14\"/><circle cx=\"340\" cy=\"85\" r=\"14\" fill=\"#28766f\"/><circle cx=\"860\" cy=\"85\" r=\"14\" fill=\"#28766f\"/><text x=\"340\" y=\"136\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"30\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"400\">12</text><text x=\"860\" y=\"136\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"30\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"400\">17</text><text x=\"600\" y=\"37\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" fill=\"#28766f\" font-weight=\"700\">Both boundaries included</text></svg></figure><pre class=\"code\" style=\"font-size:26px;line-height:1.3\">(age ≥ 12) AND (age ≤ 17)</pre><p>Test age = 12, then age = 18.</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\"><strong>true; false.</strong> Both comparisons must be true.</div></details>",
    "note": "数轴实心端点表示包含12和17。必须拆成两个完整关系再AND连接，不写12≤age≤17这种未提供的连写语法。不假设短路求值；本课表达式没有副作用。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Evaluate the inner group first",
    "tag": "GROUPED EXPRESSIONS",
    "time": "36–40 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.E/F",
    "html": "<p class=\"lead\">A is true, B is false, and C is true.</p><pre class=\"code\" style=\"font-size:26px;line-height:1.3\">A AND (B OR C)</pre><ol><li>Evaluate B OR C.</li><li>Combine that result with A.</li></ol><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\"><strong>true, then true.</strong> Parentheses make the intended grouping explicit.</div></details>",
    "note": "对复杂条件先圈内部表达式。这里不是新增逻辑运算优先级记忆题；所有混合逻辑运算均用括号明确分组。学生要能口述每一步操作数是Boolean值。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Negating a group changes the connector",
    "tag": "LOGICAL EQUIVALENCE",
    "time": "40–42 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.F · De Morgan application",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"De Morgan equivalences negate each Boolean operand and exchange AND with OR.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 195\" style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"15\" y=\"12\" width=\"1170\" height=\"77\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600\" y=\"61\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">NOT (A AND B)  =  (NOT A) OR (NOT B)</text><rect x=\"15\" y=\"105\" width=\"1170\" height=\"77\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600\" y=\"154\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">NOT (A OR B)  =  (NOT A) AND (NOT B)</text></svg></figure><p>De Morgan: negate each operand and swap AND / OR.</p><details><summary>Show why keeping AND is wrong</summary><div class=\"answer\">For A = false, B = true: NOT (A AND B) is <strong>true</strong>; (NOT A) AND (NOT B) is <strong>false</strong>.</div></details>",
    "note": "等号在图中表达两Boolean表达式对所有输入都有相同值，不是赋值。De Morgan作为AAP-2.F的逻辑应用，不虚构独立官方学习目标。用反例检查错误变形比死记符号更可靠。"
  },
  {
    "title": "The outside of a closed range",
    "tag": "APPLY THE NEGATION",
    "time": "42–44 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.E/F",
    "html": "<pre class=\"code\" style=\"font-size:26px;line-height:1.3\">NOT ((age ≥ 12) AND (age ≤ 17))</pre><figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Outside the closed12 to17 interval; open endpoints exclude12 and17 from the outside region.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 150\" style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><path d=\"M80 82H1120\" stroke=\"#193148\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M80 82H330M870 82H1120\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"13\"/><circle cx=\"340\" cy=\"82\" r=\"13\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><circle cx=\"860\" cy=\"82\" r=\"13\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><text x=\"340\" y=\"135\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"30\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"400\">12</text><text x=\"860\" y=\"135\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"30\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"400\">17</text><text x=\"190\" y=\"38\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" fill=\"#28766f\" font-weight=\"400\">Below 12</text><text x=\"1000\" y=\"38\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" fill=\"#28766f\" font-weight=\"400\">Above 17</text></svg></figure><p>Write an equivalent expression without NOT.</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\"><strong>(age &lt; 12) OR (age &gt; 17).</strong> The boundary ages remain inside.</div></details>",
    "note": "结合上一页：否定AND变OR，否定≥变<，否定≤变>。空心端点让边界是否进入outside一目了然。图给概念支架，等价代码仍留到学生作答后揭晓。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Set up a Workshop Rule Checker",
    "tag": "LAB SETUP",
    "time": "44–49 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.E/F",
    "html": "<p class=\"lead\"><a href=\"Chapter_3_Programming_Lab.html#boolean\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Open Programming Lab → Boolean</a></p><p>Fictional rule: age 12–17 inclusive, and booked OR hasPass.</p><pre class=\"code\" style=\"font-size:26px;line-height:1.3\">12\nfalse\ntrue</pre><p class=\"small\">Input queue: age, booked, hasPass. Use an integer age (0–120) and Boolean literals, one JSON scalar per line.</p>",
    "note": "规则是本课堂自定的假想工作坊要求，不引用现实许可政策。年龄域0至120包括不符合资格的合法测试输入。第二第三行是Boolean不加引号，不输入列表。说明本课只报告true/false，不控制实际进入行为。"
  },
  {
    "title": "1 · Break the rule into named conditions",
    "tag": "RULE CHECKER · 5 MINUTES",
    "time": "49–54 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.E/F",
    "html": "<ol><li>inRange: age is from 12 through 17.</li><li>hasEntry: booked OR hasPass.</li><li>eligible: inRange AND hasEntry.</li><li>Display all three Boolean results with labels.</li></ol><details><summary>Show planning support</summary><div class=\"answer\"><span class=\"mono\">inRange ← (age ≥ 12) AND (age ≤ 17)<br>hasEntry ← booked OR hasPass</span></div></details>",
